            "cheat_in_blocked_without_owen_silences_the_chain"
          ],
          "note": "Real BT24-082 Owen + real BT24-008 Elizamon + real BT24-012 Dimetromon: cheat-in digivolve auto-fires the [When Digivolving] swap; the security trash pays out BOTH buried inherited -> +2 memory (net -1 = -3 digivolve cost +2). Gated on Owen."
        },
