          "note": "FIXED: would-leave shield selector changed select_own_permanent -> select_any_permanent in EX11-012.yaml (DCGO permanent.IsToken, any owner). EX11-012 now survives by deleting the opponent Petrification token, which also trashes their security. Gap G-EX11-012-TOKEN-SHIELD-OWN-ONLY RESOLVED."
